@@ -8,6 +8,15 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-11-06
+
+### Changed
+
+- Tool input is validated against the tool's declared `inputSchema` before the tool runs: a call the
+  schema rejects returns a readable rejection to the model as the tool result instead of throwing, so
+  the model can correct the call within the same conversation. Executors now receive only input the
+  schema accepts, so a tool that hand-checked its arguments stops needing to.
+
 ## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-17
 
 ### Changed
